# Digit DP (Gold › Dynamic Programming)
# Two warm-up roots, a digit tally and the adjacent-digit walk, joining at
# Piling Papers; remainders and base-3 carries are stretch.
core  usaco-435 > usaco-1307  # tally digits under a tight prefix
core  cses-2220 > usaco-1307  # last digit in the state, tight prefix

side  cses-2220 > cf-628D      # position parity and remainder in the state
side  usaco-1307 > usaco-1115  # two numbers' digits in step, with carries
